## Status

This chapter provides the normative foundation for implementing and enforcing commons-based services within OBA systems. It should remain stable across versions because it establishes core principles for the design, funding, governance, and maintenance of essential services. Changes in this chapter are high-impact and typically affect the OBA framework significantly, especially in terms of accountability, transparency, and fairness in public service provision.

